#. <CLT 4>乱雑に物が詰め込まれている。
#. 芝刈り機に植木鉢…肥料やら農具やら……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This place seems totally disorganized. From a\n"
"lawnmower to fertilizer, flowerpots to farm tools...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに…奥に立て掛けられてるのは、
#. ツルハシか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And leaning against the back wall... Is that a\n"
"pickaxe?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>芝刈り機だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a lawnmower here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có một cái máy cắt cỏ ở đây...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>こんな物があっても、
#. 誰が、芝の手入れをするんだよ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even with this here, who's actually gonna take care of\n"
"the lawn?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>植木鉢か…
#. 大小、取り揃えているな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So many flowerpots—big ones, little ones, any size you\n"
"might need.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>部屋に花でも飾ろうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I'll grow some flowers to put in my room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>肥料だ…
#. 色々な種類があるみたいだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Bags of fertilizer are piled up. There are so many\n"
"different kinds to choose from...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>農具か…
#. これで自給自足でもしろって言うのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are different kinds of gardening tools here. Are\n"
"they trying to get us to become self-sufficient...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このツルハシ…？
#. 柄の部分に字が彫り込んであるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? There's something carved into the handle of this\n"
"pickaxe...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Hả? Có thứ gì đó được khắc trên cán của cây cuốc\n"
"chim này...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 3>暮威慈畏…大亜紋土<CLT>…？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "<CLT 3>Crazy...diamond<CLT>...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって…
#. どこかで…見覚えがあるような…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I feel like...I remember seeing that...somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>白いビニールシートか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a white tarp.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>色以外には、
#. 特に気になる点は…ないな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Besides the fact that it's not blue like most tarps, I\n"
"don't see anything remarkable about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう少し調べてみよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should look around a little bit more...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0016 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>物置から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the toolshed?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi kho dụng cụ?\n"
"<CLT>"
